8. Accordingly, this Court proceeds to pass the following:
ORDER (i) The appeal in MFA.No.202145/2018 is allowed in part;
(ii) The judgment and award passed by the Tribunal in MVC.No.418/2016 is hereby modified;
(iii) The appellants are held entitled to enhanced compensation of Rs.8,05,800/-
with 2017 ACJ 2700 SC NC: 2024:KHC-K:8408 C/W MFA.CROB No. 200007 of 2019 interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition till the date of realization.

